Dear submitter,

A DDBJ curator (<%= @curator.uid %>) has posted a message on your <%= @request.db.humanize %> request (<%= @request.submission&.source_id.presence || "##{@request.id}" %>):

<% if @message.body.present? -%>
<%= @message.body.lines.map { "  #{it}" }.join.chomp %>
<% end -%>
<%= render 'files', message: @message -%>

Open the thread on the web UI to reply:
<%= WebApp.url_for("/requests/#{@request.id}") %>

Regards,
DDBJ Repository
